Put on a ring of teleport control, then read a cursed scroll
of teleportation or step onto level teleporter (a trap). Level
teleporters can be found beyond dungeon level 15 or so. Don't wear
anything magic-resistive (like cloak of m.r. or gray dragon
scale mail) during this. You'd better also have fire resistance
before beaming down.


